"""
Zoom meetings, webinars, users, and cloud-recording automation node.

Provides workflow integration with the Zoom REST API (v2) for operations including:
- Meetings: list, create, get, update, delete, past details, participants, registrants, invitation, recordings
- Webinars: list, create, get, update, delete, registrants
- Users: list, create, get, update, delete, recordings
- Recordings: account-wide list, meeting recordings get/delete
- Phone: list call logs
- Team Chat: send a chat message
- Webhook Trigger: receive Zoom event notifications (meeting.started, recording.completed, etc.)

Authentication: OAuth 2.0 Bearer tokens only (Zoom has no static API key).
  - Primary self-serve path: Server-to-Server OAuth (account_credentials grant).
    The node mints a fresh 1-hour access token at request time from
    account_id + client_id + client_secret, so no user redirect is needed.
  - Also supported: user-delegated OAuth (authorization_code) credential model.

API Base URL: https://api.zoom.us/v2
Token URL: https://zoom.us/oauth/token
Documentation: https://developers.zoom.us/docs/api/
"""

